  "eventtitle": "Legacy to Intelligence: Popular's GenBI Journey on AWS",
  "description": "Popular, one of the most recognized retail and education brands in the region, built its reporting on a legacy infrastructure that served the business well for years. But as data volumes grew, reporting slowed and manual consolidation became a bottleneck. In this session, learn how Popular built a cloud-native data platform on AWS using Amazon S3, AWS Glue, and Amazon Redshift. With Amazon QuickSight and Amazon Q delivering generative BI capabilities, business users can now query data in natural language. Discover how this solution accelerated reporting, unified financial visibility, and laid a foundation for predictive analytics.",
